=== SURVEY ===
Surveyed all required files:
- ChargingDetailPage.tsx (758 lines) -- charge curve filters on power_kw!=null (line 141), temp filter OR-based (line 164), advanced params reads ChargingTelemetry fields (line 657-731)
- charging_handler.go -- chargeTelemetryMappings: ACChargingPower->power_kw, DCChargingPower->dc_power_kw, no battery_temp mapping
- charging_telemetry_handler.go -- chargingTelemetryMappings: field names DON'T match frontend ChargingTelemetry type (charger_current vs charger_actual_current, charge_rate vs charge_rate_mph, energy_added_ac vs charge_energy_added_kwh). Missing: ChargeState, ACChargingPower, ChargerPhases, IdealBatteryRange
- types.ts -- ChargeTelemetryReading has battery_temp (line 141), ChargingTelemetry expects charger_actual_current, charger_power_kw, charger_phases, battery_range_mi, charge_rate_mph, charge_energy_added_kwh, charging_state
- signal_types.go -- ModuleTempMax (line 73), ChargeState (line 92), ChargerPhases (line 61), IdealBatteryRange (line 71) all exist. ChargerPilotCurrent does NOT exist.
- AREA_DEFAULTS already has connectNulls:true and dot:false
- converters.go -- toFloatOk() available for AC/DC merge

=== REASONING ===

Issue 1 -- Charge Curve (DC power):
- Backend maps AC->power_kw and DC->dc_power_kw separately
- Frontend filters power_kw!=null, so DC rows get excluded
- FIX: In charging_handler.go TelemetryReadings(), after pivot, merge dc_power_kw into power_kw (prefer DC when positive), delete dc_power_kw from rows. Per ADR-002: if neither has data -> leave NULL.

Issue 2 -- Temperature chart:
- No ModuleTempMax mapping -> battery_temp never returned
- FIX: Add {Signal: "ModuleTempMax", Field: "battery_temp"} to chargeTelemetryMappings
- Sparse temp data: AREA_DEFAULTS already has connectNulls:true, but the filter pre-removes ALL null rows, reducing data points to a sparse set
- FIX: Change tempData to map ALL telemetry rows (not filter), so null temps get connectNulls treatment on a continuous time axis

Issue 3 -- Advanced Charging Parameters:
- chargingTelemetryMappings field names don't match ChargingTelemetry type
- FIX: Rename fields: charger_current->charger_actual_current, charge_rate->charge_rate_mph, energy_added_ac->charge_energy_added_kwh
- Add NEW mappings: ChargeState->charging_state, ACChargingPower->charger_power_kw, ChargerPhases->charger_phases, IdealBatteryRange->battery_range_mi
- Add DC power merge post-processing in Latest() handler
- ChargerPilotCurrent does NOT exist in signal registry -- leave unmapped (ADR-002: null -> dash)

